[[Oregon State Senate|State Senator]] [[David Brock Smith]],<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.yahoo.com/news/articles/oregon-republican-lawmaker-running-unseat-220901834.html|title=Oregon Republican lawmaker running to unseat Merkley in US Senate race|author=Bourgeois, Michaela|date=March 3, 2026|access-date=March 10, 2026|work=Yahoo}}</ref> won the Republican primary that was held on May 19, 2026, defeating a crowded field of candidates, with former [[Linn County, Oregon|Linn County]] Republican Party chair [[Jo Rae Perkins]]<ref name="rc" /> finishing second.<ref>{{Cite web |date=May 19, 2026 |title=2026 Oregon U.S. Senate Primary Election Live Results |url=https://apnews.com/projects/elections-2026/oregon-primary-results-us-senate/ |access-date=May 23, 2026 |publisher=Associated Press |language=en}}</ref>
